    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 34 Bayside Square North is a three-bedroom end-of-terrace family residence set in a peaceful cul-de-sac beside a generous open green. Bayside has for many years been a sought-after location for first-time purchasers and young families, offering a settled residential environment together with an exceptional amount of open park space, tree-lined streets and convenient access to the coast. No. 34 benefits from all of that, with green space directly adjoining the property and Bayside Square just a one minute’s stroll away.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends across two storeys. On the ground floor, the entrance hall opens into a light-filled open-plan living room and dining area, with the kitchen set separately off the dining space. The upper level contains three bedrooms and a family bathroom. Externally, there are gardens to the front and rear, and a separate garage sits in a secure shared compound near the house, offering practical storage.\r\n\r\nConvenience is one of Bayside’s key advantages. The newly redeveloped Bayside Square has become a true local hub, with Aldi, Centra, a medical centre, pharmacy, gym, cafés, food outlets, crèche and other day-to-day amenities all available within a very short walk. Primary and secondary schools, sports facilities and additional shopping options are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFor those commuting, Bayside DART Station and frequent bus routes can be reached on foot, giving simple access to Dublin City Centre. Nearby too are the seafront promenade and coastal cycle track, which offer an appealing walking and cycling route along Dublin Bay toward Sutton and beyond. Taken together, the quiet setting, open green space, local shopping, schools, transport links and proximity to the coast make No. 34 an especially practical family home.\r\n\r\nViewing is strongly advised. To arrange an appointment, contact JB Kelly on 01 839 3400."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nHall\r\n1.40 x 2.15m\r\nLaminate floor, spacious storage closet.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n5.15 x 3.70m\r\nLaminate floor, stairs to upper level\r\n\r\nDining Area\r\n4.35 x 2.50m\r\nOpen plan from the living room, sliding patio door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n2.75 x 2.45m\r\nRange of floor and wall mounted units with fridge freezer, oven hob and extractor unit.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nCarpet flooring on stairs and landing, storage press and separate hotpress\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n2.70 x 4.05m\r\nDouble bedroom to the front of the property with laminate flooring and built-in closet space.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.70 x 3.20m\r\nDouble bedroom to the rear with laminate flooring and built-in closet space.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n1.90 x 3.00m\r\nLaminate flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.95 x 1.70m\r\nTiled walls and floors, WC"
      },
